flowchart LR
    P[Push to main]:::evt --> D[Deploy to Dev]:::stage
    D --> S[Deploy to Staging]:::stage
    S --> G{Manual<br/>approval}:::gate
    G -->|approved| R[Deploy to Prod]:::prod
    G -->|rejected| X[Run stops]:::finish

    classDef evt fill:#E8F4FA,stroke:#1F3864,stroke-width:2px,color:#1F3864,font-weight:bold
    classDef stage fill:#D5E8F4,stroke:#1F3864,stroke-width:2px,color:#1F3864,font-weight:bold
    classDef gate fill:#E8F4FA,stroke:#1F3864,stroke-width:2px,color:#1F3864,font-weight:bold
    classDef prod fill:#BFDBED,stroke:#1F3864,stroke-width:3px,color:#1F3864,font-weight:bold
    classDef finish fill:#E8F4FA,stroke:#1F3864,stroke-width:1px,color:#1F3864
